---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { absoluteUrl } from '../i18n';

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'AboutPage',
    url: absoluteUrl('/about/'),
    name: 'About NoMore5Mins',
    about: { '@id': `${absoluteUrl('/')}#organization` },
  },
];
---

<PageLayout
  title="About NoMore5Mins — Free Online Time Tools"
  description="NoMore5Mins makes fast, private, free time tools — alarm clock, timer, stopwatch, Pomodoro, world clock and sleep calculator — in 15 languages."
  path="/about/"
  h1="About NoMore5Mins"
  intro="We build simple time tools that open instantly, work on any device and respect your attention."
  crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About', href: '/about/' }]}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <h2>Why “no more 5 minutes”?</h2>
  <p>
    Everyone knows the moment: the alarm rings and you whisper “just 5 more minutes”. Five becomes twenty, and the
    morning is gone. NoMore5Mins started as an alarm clock with a deliberately limited snooze button and grew into a
    small set of tools for anyone who wants to use their time on purpose.
  </p>

  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/alarm-clock/">Online alarm clock</a> with eight sounds and a snooze limit</li>
    <li><a href="/timer/">Countdown timer</a> that stays accurate in background tabs</li>
    <li><a href="/stopwatch/">Stopwatch</a> with lap times to 1/100 second</li>
    <li><a href="/pomodoro-timer/">Pomodoro timer</a> for focused work and study</li>
    <li><a href="/clock/">Current time</a> and <a href="/world-clock/">world clock</a></li>
    <li><a href="/sleep-calculator/">Sleep calculator</a> based on 90-minute sleep cycles</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we work</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Fast.</strong> Pages are static, tiny and load in well under a second on a normal connection.</li>
    <li><strong>Private.</strong> Alarms, timers and settings are stored only in your browser. We have no accounts and no database of users.</li>
    <li><strong>Honest.</strong> We explain limitations plainly — for example, a browser alarm only rings while the tab is open.</li>
    <li><strong>Global.</strong> Every tool is available in 15 languages and uses your local time format.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How the site is funded</h2>
  <p>
    NoMore5Mins is free. It is supported by advertising and by affiliate links to products we think are genuinely
    useful for sleep and focus. Ads are never placed inside the tools themselves and never interrupt a running alarm or
    timer. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Found a bug, missing a language or have an idea? <a href="/contact/">Send us a message</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
